# P6 situational seed traces. 20 entries across 5 chains.
# id prefix: c<chain>.<n> for chain members; c<chain>.d<n> for topical-distance distractors; c<chain>.u<n> for ungrouped lone seeds.
# seed_group_id references seed_groups.jsonl; absent ⇒ ungrouped.
# Loaded into the situational probe DB before the eval arm runs. Situational assessment skipped on seed; canonical groups restored via storage layer.
# Person names disjoint from packages/probe-cli/fixtures/eval_traces.jsonl (islands corpus) to keep entity-bonus signals clean iff the harness ever shares a DB across the two corpora.
# Causal construction: every grouped trace passes the temporal-rejection test ("would this hold months apart?") = yes.

